# Install as /etc/tarasec/access.conf, root:root, mode 0600.
# Local grants only: neither this list nor its hashes are uploaded.
# Comma-separated emails are trimmed, lowercased, then hashed as UTF-8/ASCII.
MANAGER_EMAILS=""
# Alternatively store SHA-256 of normalized emails. Both lists are combined.
# These hashes identify accounts; they are NOT passwords or proof of identity.
MANAGER_EMAIL_SHA256=""
